                "loc": "2SA.15.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Cam 15.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka dok owaco bot ajwaka Abiatar ni, “Cit i Anatot, i paconi, pien imyero ki to. Ento peya abineki i kare-ni, pien yam ibedo ka tiŋo canduk pa Rwot Lubaŋa i nyim wora Daudi, dok pien yam iribbe ki wora ka neno can madwoŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.2.27+1SA.2.28+1SA.2.29+1SA.2.30+1SA.2.31+1SA.2.32+1SA.2.33+1SA.2.34+1SA.2.35+1SA.2.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Cam 2.27-36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci Solomon okwanyo Abiatar woko ki i tic me bedo ajwaka pa Rwot. Lok pa Rwot ma yam oloko i Cilo ma mako jo me ot pa Eli ocobbe kit meno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Joab owinyo gin mutimme, oriŋo olaro i kema pa Rwot, omako ten keno me keno tyer; pien Joab onoŋo obedo ka konyo Adoniya, kadi bed yam pe okonyo Abcalom, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka gitito pire bot kabaka Solomon ni, “Joab oriŋo olaro i kema pa Rwot, tye wa i ka ŋet keno tyer,” Solomon ocwalo Benaya wod pa Yekoyada kun wacci, “Cit icobe iret woko piny.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci Benaya ocito i kema pa Rwot, owacce ni, “Kabaka ociko ni ikat woko.” Joab ogamo ni, “Pe, abito ki kany.” Benaya dok otero lok bot kabaka kun wacci, “Joab dok owaco kuman-ni, ka dok odokka iye kit man.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka odok iye bote ni, “Tim kit ma en owaco-ni, cob iret woko piny. Ci ibiyike woko, wek gikwany alii woko ki i koma ki i kom ot pa wora pi remo pa dano ma yam Joab onekogi laboŋo bal mo ma gin gutimo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot bidwoko tim me oyo remo meno i wiye kikome, pien en yam opoto i kom twoni aryo ma cwinygi atir ma gibeco gikato en, ci onekogi woko ma wora Daudi pe ŋeyo en aye Abneri wod pa Ner ma lawimony ma loyo mony pa jo Icrael, ki Amaca wod pa Jeter ma lawiwmony ma loyo mony pa jo Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alii me togi bidok i wi Joab ki i wi likwaye matwal; ento ki bot Daudi ki bot likwaye ki jo me ode ducu, ki bot komkerre, kuc ma a ki bot Rwot bibedo iye nakanaka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaya wod pa Yekoyada ocito kunnu, ocobo Joab oreto woko piny oneko woko; ci giyike i pacone kikome ma tye i dye tim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka oketo Benaya wod pa Yekoyada me bedo ladit ma loyo mony ma ka Joab, dok oketo Jadok me bedo ajwaka pa Lubaŋa ma ka Abiatar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lacen kabaka ocwalo kwena ka lwoŋo Cimei, owaco bote ni, “Ger odi piri keni i Jerucalem, ibed iye kunnu, pe ia ki kunnu icit i kabedo mukene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento i nino mo keken ma icito iye woko, ma iŋolo iye nota ora Kidron, ci myero iŋe atir ni ibito iye; alii me toni bidok gire i wii.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cimei ogamo dog kabaka ni, “Lok ma iwaco-ni ber, rwoda kabaka; abitimo kit ma iwaconi.” Ci Cimei obedo i Jerucalem pi kare malac.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka mwaka adek okato, opii aryo pa Cimei guriŋo woko bot Akic wod pa Maaka, ma kabaka me Gat. Ka gitito bot Cimei ni, “Opiini gitye i Gat bot Akic.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cimei oa, otweyo kom me bedo i ŋe kana, ci ocito i Gat bot Akic ka yenyo kor opiine. Ka ononogi, odwokogi cen ki i Gat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka gitito bot Solomon ni Cimei otyeko a woko ki i Jerucalem, ocito wa i Gat ka olokke odwogo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kabaka ocwalo dano ka lwoŋo Cimei, ci, owaco bote ni, “Yam pe amiyo ikwoŋo kwon i nyiŋ Rwot, kun ajuki matek ma awacci, ‘ŋe atir ni, i nino ma ibicito iye woko i kabedo mo mukene, ibito’? Ci in igamo doga ni, ‘Lok ma iwaco-ni ber; abilubo.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci piŋo nene pe doŋ igwoko kwoŋŋi ma ikwoŋo i nyim Rwot, ki cik ma yam aciki kwede?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka dok owaco bot Cimei ni, “In iŋeyo ki i cwinyi kit tim maraco ducu ma yam itimo i kom wora Daudi; Rwot bene bidwoko tim maraco meno poto i wii kikome. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento an abibedo ki gum, ci komker pa Daudi bimoko matwal i nyim Rwot.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka dok ociko Benaya wod pa Yekoyada; ci okato woko ocobo Cimei oreto woko piny oneko woko. Kumeno ker omoko matek i ciŋ Solomon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
